title: Our product
perspectives: product
description: What the product is, who it is for and how it works. Look at it as Product, Technical, User or Senior management (top bar).

mindmap why: Why it exists [tags: product exec] {
  The problem
    Who has it
    What it costs them today
  What we offer
  How we know it works
}

group users: Who uses it {
  persona: A typical user [person, tags: user product, detail: What they want and what gets in their way]
  journey: Their first week [tags: user, detail: Sign up, first success, coming back]
}

group how: How it works {
  web: Web app [rounded, tags: tech]
  api: API [tags: tech]
  db: Database [cylinder, tags: tech]
}
web -> api -> db

adr stack: Pick the stack [proposed] {
  context: What we need from it
  decision: Still open
}

question: What do we not know yet? [sticky, tags: product user]
